<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank raises Rheinmetall to &quot;above average&quot;.</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank raises Rheinmetall to &quot;above average&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank said on Thursday it had raised its share recommendation for German defence and engineering group Rheinmetall AG to &quot;above average&quot; from &quot;market neutral&quot; after the company announced on Wednesday it was taking a 24.99 percent stake in car components firm Kolbenschmidt AG.</p>
<p>Vereinsbank also said it was keeping its recommendation for Kolbenschmidt unchanged at &quot;above average.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
